        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lewiston%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lewiston hosts California’s third‑largest reservoir, Trinity Dam, which sits just above the town’s main street.",
